  "description": "Nissan floor mats include 2 front floor mats & 1 rear floor liner; Made by unique precision digital laser scanning to protect the front and back of your vehicle’s footwell. Completely and accurately lines the interior carpet.\nFeatures\nPerfect fit. OEDRO floor mats are made of unique precision digital laser scanning to protect the front and back of the Honda Civic's footwell. Completely accurate floor liner.\nGuarded around the clock. The TPE component of the floor mat ensures that it is 100% safe, 100% odorless, and environmentally friendly in all weather (rain, fog, snow, etc.).\nStrong and sturdy. The temperature resistance of OEDRO foot pads is 300% higher than that of PVC. The high-density TPE material not only feels good and is extremely wear-resistant, but also maintains flexibility in extremely cold weather.\nEasy to clean. Wipe easily. The grooves on the surface of the OEDRO floor mat can capture liquid, milk, snow, dirt, sand, etc., to keep your car and shoes clean.\n2 years warranty. For your safety, professional installation is highly recommended.\nFitment\nCompatible for 2014-2015 Nissan Altima.\nCompatible for 2016-2020 Nissan Maxima.",
